values ($v$VECTIS$v$, $v$vectis$v$, $v$group$v$, 1956, $v$A diversified Nigerian business group, established in 1956, connecting capital, capability and opportunity.$v$, $v${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "VECTIS brings investment management, enterprise development, operating platforms and strategic partnerships into one integrated architecture."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Founded in Nigeria and established in 1956, the group focuses on productive sectors, infrastructure and long-term value creation."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Five connected business clusters"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The portfolio is designed as an integrated system, not a flat list of businesses:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Investment and financial services"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Energy and natural resources"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Industry and productive enterprises"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Infrastructure and commercial services"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Partnerships and social impact"}]}]}]}]}$v$::jsonb, 0, $v$VECTIS · Established 1956 · A Nigerian business group$v$, $v$VECTIS brings investment management, enterprise development, operating platforms and strategic partnerships into one integrated architecture.$v$, $v$published$v$)
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

